WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:04,080
Brother

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,490
You have such an ability to listen to the wind and water

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,930
It’s less nonsense than writing based on the gods in books

4
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:12,920
What are you looking at if you keep it and leave to promote immortality?

5
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,360
This is what the Kowloon platoon officer found

6
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,060
The real Kowloon platoon official

7
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,770
Brother Changsheng is right behind the door

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:30,050
We are blowing up Nantianmen.

9
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,260
There are dead people buried in Nantianmen, so don’t look at it blindly.

10
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:38,740
No chain store can open such a big door like this.

11
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,980
Why can't it be opened? This is a door to death.

12
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,420
Sealed from the inside
